WEBVTT

00:56:59.371 --> 00:57:01.117
but it wasn't up to me.

00:57:01.141 --> 00:57:05.709
It ended the way it ended, but now
I get to have whatever's coming.

00:57:06.328 --> 00:57:09.302
And it is ashes to ashes, dust to dust,

00:57:09.326 --> 00:57:13.142
and it is amazing, and I wouldn't
miss it for the world.

00:57:14.431 --> 00:57:18.885
CA: Liz Gilbert, to hear those words
from someone who has been through

00:57:18.909 --> 00:57:20.179
what you've been through,

00:57:20.203 --> 00:57:24.586
I mean, that's one of the most
powerful and inspiring things

00:57:24.610 --> 00:57:26.957
I think I can remember.

00:57:26.981 --> 00:57:28.798
So I don't know what to say.

00:57:28.822 --> 00:57:33.650
Thank you so much for coming,
spending this time, opening your heart